  <Properties>
    <description>
      <Value><![CDATA[This meeting is NOT AWS specific, but is related to our April meeting (ARM on AWS: Migrating AWS services to the Graviton2 processor).

Thinking about moving from Intel to a new ARM-based Mac? I will share my experience moving my PHP and Laravel dev workflow to the new Apple Silicon M1 processor, including building ARM and x86 Docker containers on the M1.]]></Value>
